.TH RFID-BLUETOOTH-KEYBOARD-PAIR 1 "2026-07-28" "GWAY local tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rfid-bluetooth-keyboard-pair \- open a bounded Bluetooth keyboard pairing window
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rfid-bluetooth-keyboard-pair
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs a bounded Bluetooth pairing workflow for keyboards and mirrors short PIN or
passkey prompts to the LCD event channel.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --duration " SECONDS"
Pairing window length.
.TP
.BI --pin-seconds " SECONDS"
LCD display duration for PIN/passkey prompts.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rfid-bind-bluetooth-keyboard-pair (1)
